  "description": "Draws decoded video frames onto a Skia drawing surface, so a video player can show its picture using the same drawing technology as the rest of your UI. Converts video color data to on-screen color efficiently, using the GPU when one is available and falling back to an optimized CPU path otherwise. Supports letterboxing, custom overlay drawing on top of the video, and capturing the composed frame as an image.",
